OL,3,GNEWSAHome unfit to live in after tumble
OL,4,Adryer fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire believed to have been caused by
OL,7,Fa tumble dryer has left a house unfit
OL,8,Fto live in.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called to the home in
OL,11,FLewell Way, West Knighton, on Thursday
OL,12,Fat about 10:40 BST.
OL,14,FDorset & Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService said crews found that the fire
OL,16,Fon the ground floor involving a tumble
OL,17,Fdryer had spread through the house to
OL,18,Fthe first floor, "leaving the property
OL,19,Funinhabitable".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
